cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Figra in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Figra: A browser-based Excel add-in for publication-quality scientific visualization"
abstract: >
  Figra is a Microsoft Excel Office Add-in that enables researchers to generate
  publication-quality scientific figures directly from spreadsheet data using ggplot2
  and R, executed client-side via WebAssembly (webR). No R installation is required.
  Figra supports 18 chart types, integrated statistical analysis, and exports
  educational R code to support reproducibility and learning.
authors:
